<https://ontoboard.org/patterns/nfdi-sparql-endpoint-dataset.owl> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                                   dcterms:description "A queryable endpoint (nfdi:NFDI_0001095) is modelled as a part of the dataset it serves, linked with obo:BFO_0000051 (has part), rather than as a property of the dataset. This keeps the endpoint addressable and separately describable."^^xsd:string ;
                                                                   dcterms:license <https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT> ;
                                                                   dcterms:title "sparql_endpoints"^^xsd:string ;
                                                                   rdfs:comment """Curated by OntoBoard 1.155.0, so that the pattern passes ODK's quality report with its default profile, names every term with a label, and is consistent and coherent. Changes: label added x7; term declared x3;
- header: dcterms:title \"sparql_endpoints\" - the library's name for the pattern
- header: dcterms:description - the library's description of the pattern
- header: dcterms:license <https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT> - https://github.com/ISE-FIZKarlsruhe/matwerk
Each change is listed under \"curated\" in the pattern's metadata.json in OntoBoard's pattern library."""@en .

